<TextPage
  title="About FinForecast"
  heading="About FinForecast"
  description="FinForecast is an independent, non-commercial site publishing daily statistical price forecasts and technical analysis."
  lead="Independent, data-driven price forecasts, updated every day."
>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>
    FinForecast publishes statistical price forecasts for selected financial assets: daily values for the next 30 days, monthly
    averages to 2030 and a yearly outlook to 2035, together with a full technical analysis. Silver is covered today; gold and
    bitcoin are next.
  </p>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Transparent.</strong> Every model, parameter and signal rule is described on the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> page.</li>
    <li><strong>Automatic.</strong> Prices, forecasts, technical analysis and the text on each page are recalculated every day.</li>
    <li><strong>Measured.</strong> Every forecast is archived and compared with what actually happened.</li>
    <li><strong>Neutral.</strong> We have nothing to sell: no ads, no affiliate links and no trading accounts.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who is behind it</h2>
  <p>
    The methodology and the analyst data are reviewed by <a href="/authors/margerie-holtz/">Margerie Holtz</a>, Senior Analyst,
    M.A. International Economics (HWR Berlin).
  </p>

  <h2>Data</h2>
  <p>Market data is provided by Twelve Data and Alpha Vantage. The site is non-commercial.</p>

  <p class="meta">Nothing on this site is investment advice. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>
</TextPage>
